---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13615550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(361) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Roach Control Victoria TX | Cockroach Extermination" description="Effective cockroach control in Victoria, TX. German, American and other roaches eliminated with thorough, professional treatment.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Services → Roach Control</div>
      <h1>Roach Control in Victoria, TX</h1>
      <p>Stop the spread. Cockroaches multiply fast — professional treatment stops the cycle.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Why Roaches Are Hard to Beat Alone</h2>
      <p>German cockroaches hide in cracks and appliances and can produce thousands of offspring. Store-bought sprays often scatter them without eliminating the population. Professional treatment targets harborage and uses products that reach where sprays cannot.</p>
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Thorough inspection of kitchens, bathrooms, utility rooms and appliances</li>
        <li>Gel baits, residual treatments and insect growth regulators as appropriate</li>
        <li>Focus on cracks, voids and moisture sources</li>
        <li>Guidance on sanitation that supports long-term results</li>
        <li>Follow-up visits when needed for heavy infestations</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Roach Treatment</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
